{
  "slug": "hwpx",
  "name": "Hwpx",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Read, write, and convert HWP/HWPX (한글) documents — South Korea's dominant document format. Extract text, math equations, images, and tables from HWP/HWPX files. Generate HWPX documents programmatically with B4/A4 layouts, equations, and images. Convert between HWP/HWPX and Markdown bidirectionally. Includes HWP equation script syntax knowledge, HWPX XML schema reference, and ready-to-run Python converter scripts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `hwpx` (Use this skill whenever the user wants to create, read, edit, or manipulate HWP/HWPX documents (한글 문서)).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hwpx@claude-community` from `hohyon-ryu/claude-hwpx-plugin`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin for reading, writing, and converting HWP/HWPX documents — the dominant document format in South Korea used by government, education, and enterprise.",
